Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:48.39,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur12\t(0,300,\blur2)\t(300,2095,\blur4)\t(3890,4190,\blur12)}猝不及防闖入我心扉的你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:54.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur12\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\shad2\4c&H7D4334&}祈盼著你能長伴身側
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:22:00.11,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur12\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\shad2\4c&H7D4334&}此願越深 心頭越是隱隱作痛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:08.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur12\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\shad2\4c&H7D4334&}縱然如此 眸光亦只一往情深地追隨
